    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "PCIe SSD architecture, submission/completion queues, and blk-mq integration",
      "source_hash": 3895546498580275794,
      "context_hash": 2610281679269321229,
      "translation": "PCIe SSD 아키텍처, 제출/완료 큐, blk-mq 통합",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PCIe": "PCIe",
        "SSD": "SSD",
        "blk-mq": "blk-mq",
        "queues": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "NVMe overview",
      "source_hash": 13285410099398516334,
      "context_hash": 16500849254844625571,
      "translation": "NVMe 개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NVMe": "NVMe"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "NVMe (Non-Volatile Memory Express) is the protocol for PCIe-attached SSDs.",
      "source_hash": 8702492007407969050,
      "context_hash": 4565319406142167090,
      "translation": "NVMe(Non-Volatile Memory Express)는 PCIe로 연결된 SSD를 위한 프로토콜입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NVMe": "NVMe",
        "PCIe": "PCIe",
        "SSDs": "SSD"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The NVMe 1.0 specification was ratified in March 2011; the Linux kernel driver first appeared in Linux 3.3 (March 2012), written by Matthew Wilcox (Intel) — [`b60503ba432b`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/b60503ba432b16fc84442a84e29a7aad2c0c363d).",
      "source_hash": 5240579881133587234,
      "context_hash": 3900531116377088257,
      "translation": "NVMe 1.0 사양은 2011년 3월에 승인되었으며, Linux 커널 드라이버는 Matthew Wilcox(Intel)가 작성하여 Linux 3.3(2012년 3월)에 처음 등장했습니다 — [`b60503ba432b`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/b60503ba432b16fc84442a84e29a7aad2c0c363d).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Intel": "Intel",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "Linux kernel": "Linux 커널",
        "NVMe": "NVMe",
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "It's designed for low latency and high parallelism:",
      "source_hash": 16464046320763170867,
      "context_hash": 8858243330805265566,
      "translation": "낮은 지연 시간과 높은 병렬성을 목표로 설계되었습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "latency": "지연 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "NVMe queue architecture",
      "source_hash": 6217017671669419261,
      "context_hash": 5330374934866778470,
      "translation": "NVMe 큐 아키텍처",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NVMe": "NVMe",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Admin queue and I/O queues",
      "source_hash": 16883933366439518997,
      "context_hash": 10936928761479330778,
      "translation": "Admin 큐와 I/O 큐",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐",
        "queues": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Each queue is a **shared memory ring** between the CPU and the NVMe controller:",
      "source_hash": 4526887714411841320,
      "context_hash": 4070091974482816277,
      "translation": "각 큐는 CPU와 NVMe 컨트롤러 사이의 **공유 메모리 링**입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "NVMe": "NVMe",
        "controller": "컨트롤러",
        "queue": "큐",
        "shared memory": "공유 메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "NVMe submission queue entry (SQE)",
      "source_hash": 3450283843837796156,
      "context_hash": 2672618950489583378,
      "translation": "NVMe 제출 큐 엔트리(SQE)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NVMe": "NVMe",
        "SQE": "SQE",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "NVMe completion queue entry (CQE)",
      "source_hash": 15561624250943846589,
      "context_hash": 379987352241951389,
      "translation": "NVMe 완료 큐 엔트리(CQE)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CQE": "CQE",
        "NVMe": "NVMe",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "The **phase tag** allows polling for completions without a separate \"entries used\" counter: the CPU flips the expected phase bit on each CQ wrap.",
      "source_hash": 5105802613369384701,
      "context_hash": 15411031597931503334,
      "translation": "**phase tag**를 사용하면 별도의 \"사용된 엔트리\" 카운터 없이 완료를 폴링할 수 있습니다. CPU는 CQ가 한 바퀴 돌 때마다 기대하는 phase 비트를 반전합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "bit": "비트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux NVMe driver: struct nvme_dev",
      "source_hash": 16413339973825261038,
      "context_hash": 3402152994752873712,
      "translation": "Linux NVMe 드라이버: struct nvme_dev",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "NVMe": "NVMe",
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:50.146151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "blk-mq integration",
      "source_hash": 15603163992583398967,
      "context_hash": 8219410422613459572,
